WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:06.567
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:06.765 --> 00:00:09.365
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no...

00:00:09.365 --> 00:00:12.687
[alarms sound]
Huh? Heh? Ah-hah? Ah-hah-hah!

00:00:12.687 --> 00:00:15.667
Ah! I'm not in Crazy Land anymore!

00:00:16.271 --> 00:00:17.839
Oh, man!

00:00:17.839 --> 00:00:20.515
That was stranger than when I
was awake for four days straight

00:00:20.515 --> 00:00:23.400
and thought my house was being
invaded by frog people.

00:00:24.196 --> 00:00:26.418
And the door's open now!

00:00:26.418 --> 00:00:28.164
Man, I'm on a roll!

00:00:28.164 --> 00:00:30.033
Murphy's Law can suck it!

00:00:30.645 --> 00:00:31.841
Oh, hell.

00:00:31.841 --> 00:00:33.221
Is that guy dead?

00:00:33.221 --> 00:00:36.633
Dammit, I'm a doctor,
not a... normal doctor.

00:00:36.633 --> 00:00:38.809
I wonder if he was trying to
open the door for me.

00:00:38.809 --> 00:00:40.863
I'd feel like an asshole then.

00:00:40.863 --> 00:00:42.398
Wait, what am I saying?

00:00:42.398 --> 00:00:44.931
They're the ones that locked me
in this tomb to begin with!

00:00:44.931 --> 00:00:47.743
If they're not dead all ready,
they're on the list!

00:00:47.743 --> 00:00:49.140
[lock buzzes]

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:50.729
Hah, yeah, very funny.

00:00:50.729 --> 00:00:52.138
C'mon door, open up.

00:00:52.138 --> 00:00:53.006
[lock buzzes]

00:00:53.006 --> 00:00:54.569
Dammit, what a tease!

00:00:54.569 --> 00:00:58.896
I already made it passed those thick-ass
blast doors--which that guy died for--

00:00:58.896 --> 00:01:01.368
only to be stopped by this
useless second door.

00:01:01.368 --> 00:01:02.534
This is bullshit!

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:07.371
I am Captain Gordon Freeman of
the Intergalactic House of Pancakes

00:01:07.371 --> 00:01:08.734
ordering you to open!

00:01:09.713 --> 00:01:10.334
Yes!

00:01:10.812 --> 00:01:11.334
No!

00:01:12.094 --> 00:01:12.767
Shit!

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:14.868
Uh...

00:01:15.756 --> 00:01:16.434
Don't kill me!

00:01:17.295 --> 00:01:19.543
Oh, good. Somebody who knows CPR.

00:01:19.543 --> 00:01:22.571
I hate to say it, but I don't think I
could bring myself to do mouth-to-mouth

00:01:22.571 --> 00:01:24.213
on the people here.

00:01:24.213 --> 00:01:27.322
Dammit, all the babes are in the
Biology Department.

00:01:27.322 --> 00:01:30.603
I'd LEARN how to do CPR on them.

00:01:30.603 --> 00:01:33.098
That is, unless they really were dead.

00:01:33.098 --> 00:01:35.067
God, that would be such a turn-off.

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:37.738
Don't step in the blood...

00:01:37.738 --> 00:01:41.243
Man, you can just smell the
money burning in this place.

00:01:41.243 --> 00:01:42.277
Just goes to show that--

00:01:42.277 --> 00:01:44.234
[explosion]
GOD! JEEZ! GOD!

00:01:45.512 --> 00:01:47.162
I HATE COMPUTERS!

00:01:47.162 --> 00:01:49.868
WHY DO THEY ALWAYS BLOW UP
WHEN I USE THEM?!

00:01:52.869 --> 00:01:53.801
Boned.

00:01:54.925 --> 00:01:58.539
Man, this place got romped!

00:01:58.539 --> 00:02:00.832
I guess I'll start looting after all.

00:02:00.832 --> 00:02:04.178
Hm, I'll get out of here first and then
come back here with a wheelbarrow

00:02:04.178 --> 00:02:05.634
so I can really do this right.

00:02:07.284 --> 00:02:09.300
Oh no, not this again.

00:02:09.907 --> 00:02:14.474
Okay, this time I have to turn
WITH the elevator.

00:02:14.474 --> 00:02:16.268
All right, focus.

00:02:16.268 --> 00:02:20.400
Mehninmehninmehninmehninmehninmehninmehnin
mehninmehninmehninmehninmehninmehninmehnin...

00:02:21.067 --> 00:02:23.219
Oh, jeez, this doesn't feel good.

00:02:23.219 --> 00:02:24.467
I don't think it worked.

00:02:25.122 --> 00:02:25.434
[hic]

00:02:25.798 --> 00:02:28.011
Why is everything in circles?

00:02:28.011 --> 00:02:30.834
Atoms... planets... yeah.

00:02:31.269 --> 00:02:34.558
Huh-hey! Boy, we really
fucked up this time, huh?

00:02:34.558 --> 00:02:36.696
SCIENTIST #5: Why didn't they listen?

00:02:36.696 --> 00:02:39.163
SCIENTIST #4: We TRIED to warn them.

00:02:39.163 --> 00:02:42.605
SCIENTIST #5: I never thought
I'd see a resonance cascade,

00:02:42.605 --> 00:02:44.138
SCIENTIST #5: let alone create one.

00:02:44.138 --> 00:02:44.996
Sucks.

00:02:44.996 --> 00:02:46.948
SCIENTIST #5: Gordon! You're alive!

00:02:46.948 --> 00:02:48.979
SCIENTIST #5: Thank GOD for that
hazard suit!

00:02:48.979 --> 00:02:49.407
You like it?

00:02:49.407 --> 00:02:52.370
SCIENTIST #5: I'm afraid to move
him and all our phones are out.

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:54.865
SCIENTIST #5: Please, get to the
surface as soon as you can

00:02:54.865 --> 00:02:57.622
SCIENTIST #5: and let someone
know we're stranded down here.

00:02:57.622 --> 00:03:00.332
SCIENTIST #5: You'll need me to
activate the retinal scanners.

00:03:00.332 --> 00:03:03.290
SCIENTIST #5: I'm sure the rest
of the Science Team will gladly help you.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:06.418
See, that's what I like to hear:
how can you help me?

00:03:06.418 --> 00:03:10.355
If everyone here had your attitude, we
wouldn't be in this mess in the first place.

00:03:10.355 --> 00:03:11.059
[teleportation sounds]

00:03:11.059 --> 00:03:13.334
Oh my God! What is that?

00:03:14.523 --> 00:03:18.000
Holy crap, that's an alien!
I wasn't imagining it.

00:03:18.656 --> 00:03:20.342
Do they see this?

00:03:20.342 --> 00:03:22.786
HEY, I TOLD YOU ALL I'M NOT CRAZY!

00:03:22.786 --> 00:03:24.300
THE PROOF'S RIGHT HERE!

00:03:24.868 --> 00:03:28.536
Wow, it looks like one of those
facehuggers from the movie "Aliens".

00:03:28.536 --> 00:03:30.565
[headcrab squeals]
Wah! Don't kill me!

00:03:30.565 --> 00:03:32.844
I realize you're trying to
propagate your species,

00:03:32.844 --> 00:03:36.613
but I'm just down with the whole
laying-eggs-in-my-chest-cavity thing.

00:03:36.613 --> 00:03:38.267
Jeez, that's a lot of blood.

00:03:39.963 --> 00:03:40.208
[door thumps]

00:03:40.208 --> 00:03:41.485
Oh, a locked door.

00:03:41.485 --> 00:03:43.104
We're playing this game again, are we?

00:03:43.104 --> 00:03:43.701
Fine!

00:03:44.313 --> 00:03:47.400
Ugh... step in the blood... there.

00:03:48.603 --> 00:03:49.998
PA: Access denied.

00:03:49.998 --> 00:03:50.786
WHAT?!

00:03:50.786 --> 00:03:52.917
YOU DARE DEFY MY ORDERS?!

00:03:52.917 --> 00:03:54.253
THIS IS TREASON!

00:03:54.253 --> 00:03:57.841
I'LL HAVE YOU--hey, wait a minute, I think
that scientist said he could open it.

00:03:57.841 --> 00:03:58.601
I'll ask him.

00:03:59.949 --> 00:04:02.534
Don't let it smell your fear.

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:06.457
Hey, you guys have the same tie.

00:04:06.457 --> 00:04:09.902
SCIENTIST #5: A failure of this
magnitude is extremely improbable.

00:04:09.902 --> 00:04:11.312
Well, that's why we have insurance.

00:04:11.312 --> 00:04:12.721
Hey, come with me for a second.

00:04:12.721 --> 00:04:14.682
SCIENTIST #5: Fine. You won't
even know I'm here.

00:04:14.682 --> 00:04:15.300
All right.

00:04:15.808 --> 00:04:18.000
Oh, and don't mind the vicious aliens.

00:04:18.773 --> 00:04:19.868
Or the dead guy.

00:04:20.998 --> 00:04:22.467
Or the tunnel of blood.

00:04:24.787 --> 00:04:27.534
Yeah, just start that peep show
so we can get things rolling.

00:04:31.096 --> 00:04:32.900
This next door better not be locked.

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:33.931
[explosions]

00:04:33.931 --> 00:04:34.567
[explosions]
WHOA!

00:04:35.471 --> 00:04:37.814
[explosions]
Okay, the green beams of death.

00:04:37.814 --> 00:04:39.915
[explosions]
I thought we were passed this already.

00:04:39.915 --> 00:04:41.007
[explosions]
Getting a little old.

00:04:41.007 --> 00:04:42.402
[explosions]

00:04:42.402 --> 00:04:43.667
Hey, why don't you go first?

00:04:44.239 --> 00:04:45.534
C'mon, age before beauty.

00:04:46.859 --> 00:04:48.139
Fine! I'll lead.

00:04:48.139 --> 00:04:50.701
This right here is why you're
never get promoted.

00:04:52.468 --> 00:04:54.067
Okay, here we go.

00:04:55.525 --> 00:04:57.133
WAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!

00:04:57.493 --> 00:04:59.000
And he's safe!

00:04:59.687 --> 00:05:01.454
Is that guy not even coming?

00:05:01.454 --> 00:05:02.620
What a hoser.

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:06.694
When I'm in charge, I'll make sure he stays
at the bottom of the corporate ladder.

00:05:06.694 --> 00:05:08.513
Actually, I'm not sure I even
want this place

00:05:08.513 --> 00:05:09.552
[teleportation sounds]
anymore now that I--

00:05:09.552 --> 00:05:10.732
Oh God, one of them's loose.

00:05:10.732 --> 00:05:12.626
Uh... can't turn back.

00:05:12.626 --> 00:05:13.587
Okay, I can do this.

00:05:13.587 --> 00:05:14.760
[Spanish accent]
I am a matador!

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:15.583
[Spanish accent]
I fearlessly--

00:05:15.583 --> 00:05:18.254
[headcrab bite]
AH GOD! JESUS! SHIT! FUCK! Piss! God...

00:05:18.254 --> 00:05:19.388
Those things BITE!

00:05:19.388 --> 00:05:20.000
Dammit!

00:05:20.403 --> 00:05:22.915
I'm starting to feel pretty
naked here without a weapon.

00:05:22.915 --> 00:05:24.662
This is such a slap to the face.

00:05:24.662 --> 00:05:27.107
I've been meaning to take
kung fu lessons for years now

00:05:27.107 --> 00:05:28.583
because I knew there would be a day,

00:05:28.583 --> 00:05:32.095
like today, and I would be
ready, but I kept putting it off,

00:05:32.095 --> 00:05:35.342
and here I am, totally
unprepared, and not knowing kung fu.

00:05:35.342 --> 00:05:38.682
Procrastination has failed me yet again.

00:05:38.682 --> 00:05:39.900
Wait, this is it.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.773
This is my chance for redemption.

00:05:41.773 --> 00:05:45.044
It's like my entire life has leading
up to this single moment.

00:05:45.044 --> 00:05:48.701
Today, all my limbo practice pays off!

00:05:48.875 --> 00:05:53.710
[humming limbo song]

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:55.766
Oh! Cleared it!

00:05:55.766 --> 00:05:58.073
I am the limbo master.

00:05:58.073 --> 00:06:00.248
Isn't that right, dead guy?

00:06:00.248 --> 00:06:01.880
The bonus round!

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:03.767
Okay, I need to study the pattern.

00:06:04.113 --> 00:06:05.234
Hey, is it getting warmer?

00:06:05.731 --> 00:06:07.334
YAH! WOW!

00:06:07.805 --> 00:06:10.565
I almost got a free haircut and lobotomy!

00:06:10.565 --> 00:06:11.334
Damn!

00:06:12.112 --> 00:06:15.089
Hey, I can't limbo this;
it goes through the floor!

00:06:15.089 --> 00:06:16.033
That's cheating!

00:06:16.994 --> 00:06:19.634
Look at this thing! It's an
Etch-a-Sketch from Hell!

00:06:20.263 --> 00:06:22.610
Okay, I'm just going to have to wing it.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:30.322
[hums Mission: Impossible theme]

00:06:30.322 --> 00:06:31.665
Hey, is that a crowbar?

00:06:31.665 --> 00:06:33.668
Oh my God. This is friggin' perfect.

00:06:33.668 --> 00:06:36.846
Now I can beat the SNOT out of people!

00:06:36.846 --> 00:06:39.006
Oh boy, I can't wait to get back to the lobby.

00:06:39.006 --> 00:06:41.156
They'll be like, "Freeman! We
thought you were dead!"

00:06:41.156 --> 00:06:43.334
I'll be like, "You thought wrong! Pow!"

00:06:44.219 --> 00:06:46.801
Okay, time to bring on the pain.

00:06:47.512 --> 00:06:48.041
[lock buzzes]

00:06:48.041 --> 00:06:50.293
Oh-ho! Another locked door!

00:06:50.293 --> 00:06:51.666
I don't think so!

00:06:51.666 --> 00:06:52.968
I've got a crowbar!

00:06:53.312 --> 00:06:54.000
Eat this!

00:06:55.057 --> 00:06:57.023
Hey, I can just crawl through here.

00:06:57.023 --> 00:06:58.703
I am a genius.

00:06:58.703 --> 00:07:00.306
God, I love this thing!

00:07:00.306 --> 00:07:02.258
I just want to beat stuff up now.

00:07:02.258 --> 00:07:05.334
Actually, that's all I wanted to
do anyway but now it's so easy.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.535
Wickapah!

00:07:07.535 --> 00:07:09.747
"Do not use elevators."

00:07:09.747 --> 00:07:11.984
[explosion, scientists sceaming]

00:07:11.984 --> 00:07:13.999
Oh shit, they weren't kidding!

00:07:13.999 --> 00:07:14.596
[boom]

00:07:14.596 --> 00:07:16.482
Aw jeez, what do I do?

00:07:16.482 --> 00:07:18.467
The door won't open... rrrrr!

00:07:20.389 --> 00:07:21.634
Oh, what should I do?

00:07:22.397 --> 00:07:23.367
I guess, uh...

00:07:23.755 --> 00:07:24.968
SORRY!

00:07:26.586 --> 00:07:28.200
DIDN'T MEAN TO KILL YOU!

00:07:28.583 --> 00:07:30.414
Oh, man...

00:07:30.414 --> 00:07:32.601
I hope at least they were jerks...

